  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/OreSpawn_Adventure/BH_OSA_header.webp\" alt=\"Banner Header\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/OreSpawn_Adventure/BH_OSA_promo.webp\" alt=\"Banner Bisecthosting\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/OreSpawn_Adventure/BH_OSA_overview.webp\" alt=\"Banner Overview\"></h2>\n<p><strong>OreSpawn Adventure</strong> 是一款基于“Craziness Awakened”模组打造的奇幻风格整合包。在这里，你将探索一个充满神话生物、奇异维度、超模武器等内容的世界！穿梭于这些魔法土地时，你将感受到满满的怀旧气息。本整合包专为娱乐而生，内置大量实用便利（QoL）模组，助你无忧无虑地畅玩，并体验激动人心的新生物、盔甲、武器等丰富内容……</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/adventure-orespawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252fadventure-orespawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-plural-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"kofi-plural-alt\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/OreSpawn_Adventure/BH_OSA_features.webp\" alt=\"Banner Features\"></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>Orespawn</strong> - 将怀旧、冒险与刺激完美融合！</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/OreSpawn_Adventure/BH_OSA_discord.webp\" alt=\"Banner Discord\"></a></p>\n<h3>整合包备注</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>如果你是使用本整合包的YouTube博主或内容创作者，请在视频描述中添加指向本页的链接，以便他人了解你所使用的整合包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>严禁在Modrinth或CurseForge上重新上传本整合包或其任何修改版本，此规定同样适用于分发至任何其他网站。</strong> （<em>除非获得我的明确授权</em>）</li>\n</ul>",
